#: e7e14ff2e0a54c4e92ee2c594b3a7348
msgid "**DroneCore.Suite** is a one stop autopilot and flight computer solution for developers of advanced drone systems demanding high computing power and high level of modularity. It is the \"core\" of the drone containing most of its electronics in a compact form and it provides wide options for software development of the the most challenging AI and vision based applications."
